      *‚Description:€Handled the Error indicator *IN82 to be *ON only    *
      *              when the record is INACTIVE in ECNMSTF              *
      * -------------------------------------------------------------- - *
      *‚Changed by :€Sridevi Ravi           ‚Date:€05/29/19              *
